Description: Modern web control for Dreambox receivers running DreamOS
 DreamHub is a Go backend plus web UI that modernizes the native
 WebControl interface of a Dreambox (Enigma2/DreamOS satellite
 receiver): recordings, timers, the TV guide and AI recommendations,
 usable from any browser on the LAN. Runs alongside WebControl on its
 own port (8765) and never modifies it.
 .
 Includes a small Enigma2 launcher plugin: a QR code to open DreamHub
 on a phone and a backend status check, nothing more — everything else
 lives in the web UI.
